{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>There they buried, etc.</b> Since the cave's first owner was Ephron, therefore it says ״שָׁמָּה קָבְרוּ אֶת אַבְרָהָם וְאֵת שָׂרָה״ — behold, its first owners were reduced [in their share] and it passed to the heirs of Abraham, who are Isaac and Ishmael. <b>There they buried Isaac</b>, etc. — this comes to reduce Ishmael's portion, and it passed to the heirs of Isaac, who are Jacob and Esau. <b>There I buried Leah</b> — this comes to reduce Esau [from any share]. And the proof is ״בְּקִבְרִי אֲשֶׁר כָּרִיתִי לִי״ (Genesis 50:5), and the Sages of blessed memory expounded (Sotah 13a), etc."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:51:10.045750444Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}